# score: Mambo del Telar
# summary: mambo in 2-3 clave — tres montuno on the plucked guitar, breathy weave saxes, saw brass, the pack as percussion section
# tempo: 182
# time: 4/4
# key: Cm
# bars: 76
# pack: instrument.json
# reverb: 0.9
# master: rms=-14

# text @b1: the clave is a law the band obeys without being told.
# text @b17: los saxofones are bowed strings that learned to breathe.
# text @b33: the break: everyone hits the clave, once, together.
# text @b35: el mambo: the bell opens up, the trumpet climbs.
# text @b53: the shout chorus. superhuman hands, human groove.

# instruments:
#   cl = clave (perc, voice=tick, hpf=3200, rel=0.05, gain=-9, send=0.1)
#   cb = cencerro (perc, voice=tick, hpf=900, lpf=4200, dist=2, rel=0.09, gain=-9)
